    "title": "Evaluation of guardian traits",
    "sections": [
        {
            "heading": "Introduction",
            "level": 1,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "When an AI character educates a child, their personality traits influence the personality of the child, but not in a straightforward way. For example, Proud guardians are quite good at not screwing up if a child is doing well on their own."
