        {
            "heading": "Assumptions",
            "level": 2,
            "content": []
        },
        {
            "heading": "Heir",
            "level": 3,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "The Heir column was generated with values for trait effects similar to those used by Ruler Designer :"
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "For example, the value of 14.38 for Kind is the total of:"
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "+3 , from +2 diplomacy @ 1.5",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "-2 , from -2 intrigue @ 1",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "+10 , from +10 vassal_opinion @ 1",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "+3.38 , from +10 general_opinion @ 2, from 16.9% of adult characters",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "The Guardian of heir column was generated based on the heir column, using a simplified model of the events in childhood_personality_traits_events.txt and guardian_events.txt ."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Other columns",
            "level": 3,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Cardinal reflects virtue, diplomacy, and piety gain. These help a bishop earn cardinal appointment, win a papal election , and earn the loyalty of taxable bishops.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Loyalty reflects opinion of liege and tendency to stay out of factions .",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Adventurer reflects likelihood to press a claim as an adventurer , plus minor contributions from traits that will help him stay in power.",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Running the script",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "To run the script , paste it into jsenv and click \"Execute\". It only works in Firefox because I have forgotten how to write old versions of JavaScript."
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Near the bottom, you'll find heir_iv , which is probably the part you want to edit. If you only want to tweak the value of specific traits, do that in the section that begins a few lines below heir_iv . For example, if you expect assassination attempts, you could add these lines:"
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}